el pensado para viver bem, com qualidade de vida e toda a conveniência que o Batel oferece.\n\nParcerias são bem vindas!","fotos":["https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a31afe33fe006b5c288eeca/pilar-homes-images-watermark/bdcb9629-0b43-4830-800c-c28fe57bcc70.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a31afe33fe006b5c288eeca/pilar-homes-images-watermark/e261c56a-15e8-41a3-8561-e303e3ea3a4d.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a31afe33fe006b5c288eeca/pilar-homes-images-watermark/9fa1ac9f-a8ee-47fc-94f7-a20784da4344.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a31afe33fe006b5c288eeca/pilar-homes-images-watermark/b8b9b7ca-463f-477c-a070-a060bf029fda.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a31afe33fe006b5c288eeca/pilar-homes-images-watermark/54314e79-3434-4092-b065-5610b5a8281c.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a31afe33fe006b5c288eeca/pilar-homes-images-watermark/a0331484-1739-4f37-9078-602e496d59c2.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a31afe33fe006b5c288eeca/pilar-homes-images-watermark/1c7d5324-75d4-4021-8b1b-38be0f73871e.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a31afe33fe006b5c288eeca/pilar-homes-images-watermark/2249b9b1-e6c0-4d7c-9211-70812e98ce7c.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a31afe33fe006b5c288eeca/pilar-homes-images-watermark/d2b95c57-457c-440f-b264-4e82f690843b.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a31afe33fe006b5c288eeca/pilar-homes-images-watermark/b188e584-2f30-414e-bed7-448aa2aaf563.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a31afe33fe006b5c288eeca/pilar-homes-images-watermark/1cb3095f-b4f5-437e-bb94-81a362468085.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a31afe33fe006b5c288eeca/pilar-homes-images-watermark/f0e0791b-5cfd-4d27-8538-61419b972560.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a31afe33fe006b5c288eeca/pila